        "TileImage": "$($repository 60d684c4-be1c-44ee-8b63-bdafb44ab3d1).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Our client is currenly suing the GAMA Hospital in Hokkaido. To help their case, they wish to prove that the hospital is an unsafe environment. This is where you come in. Cause 3 accidents within 5 minutes inside the hospital, thus helping our client&apos;s lawsuit move forward. As always, good luck.",
